7: // two hops so the learner can watch Cache 10.20 answer, then the backend
8: // emit); 7 in Stage 4 (the Database hop inserted after the cache check —
9: // the WRITE to Primary 10.30, the fresh or stale SELECT from Replica
10: // 10.31, or the SKIP a warm cache HIT earns).
11: //
